00:33:48,620 --> 00:33:56,200
We shine our lights in the darkness of people who are not just hearers of the word, but doers as well.

451
00:33:57,600 --> 00:33:59,860
Thank you, Jesus, for your sacrifice.

452
00:33:59,860 --> 00:34:01,920
Thank you, Jesus, for your glory.

453
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:04,060
And your church.

454
00:34:04,060 --> 00:34:09,680
To be the people who proclaim your lordship to the four corners of the earth.

455
00:34:09,680 --> 00:34:13,900
May we act like we've heard that calling, Lord.

456
00:34:13,900 --> 00:34:16,400
In Jesus' name we pray.

457
00:34:16,400 --> 00:34:17,340
Amen.

458
00:34:19,820 --> 00:34:21,140
Thanks, church.

459
00:34:21,140 --> 00:34:23,440
May go in peace.

460
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,860
Hey, I'm only five minutes over.
